    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to test your aim and precision in <i>Ultimate Dunk Shooter</i>! In this fast-paced arcade basketball game, your goal is simple: draw the perfect path and shoot the ball into the hoop! With only 3 attempts per round, every shot counts. Challenge yourself to beat your high score, master tricky angles, and become the ultimate dunk master. Whether you're a casual gamer or a basketball fan, this game is packed with fun, skill, and satisfying slam dunks. How many perfect shots can you land?</p>",
